OL,3,GNEWSAWitness appeal after man fatally
OL,4,Astruck by lorry
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have named a pedestrian who died
OL,7,Fwhen he was struck by a lorry in
OL,8,FNottingham, and launched a new appeal
OL,9,Ffor witnesses.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to
OL,12,FBulwell Lane, in Old Basford, at 08:59
OL,13,FBST on 2 September after reports "a man
OL,14,Fhad been involved in a collision with a
OL,15,Florry".
OL,17,FRobert James Clark, 74, who lived
OL,18,Flocally, was pronounced dead at the
OL,19,Fscene, Nottinghamshire Police said.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
