OL,3,GNEWSAWitness appeal after man fatally
OL,4,Astruck by lorry
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe driver of the lorry stopped at the
OL,7,Fscene and continues to assist officers
OL,8,Fwith their inquiries. Officers are also
OL,9,Flooking to trace a number of
OL,10,Fpedestrians who were in the area at the
OL,11,Ftime, but have not yet given an
OL,12,Faccount.
